                    <th className="sticky left-[320px] z-40 bg-slate-900 p-3 border-b border-r border-slate-700 font-extrabold min-w-[90px] shadow-[4px_0_10px_-2px_rgba(0,0,0,0.15)] text-center">
                      Stok
